  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened institutional capacity of employers&apos; organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ILO will support the Confederation of Employers of Uzbekistan in revision of their membership documentation, development of membership strategy and deployment of membership campaigns so they are able to attract new members and finance their own membership activities. ILO will also assist CEU in adaptation and deployment of the Essentials in Occupational Safety and Health (EOSH) toolkit to a broad audience of CEU members.</narrative>
  </description>
